    "13. /db/MVLDch — Moving Load Cases - China": {"article_id": "35960417354649", "article_title": "Moving Load Cases - China", "updated_at": "2025-08-29T06:51:13Z", "verified_at": "2026-08-25", "note": "Moving Load Optimization 모드(OPT_AUTO_OPTIMIZE=true) 전용 필드 5개(MIN_VEHICLE_DIST~AUTO_OPTIMIZE_ITEMS) 완전 누락 발견·보강"},
